  "description": "Vintage Strong is a rugged vintage grunge display font featuring bold serif letterforms with authentic distressed textures. Inspired by classic western signs, old print shops, rustic branding, and retro typography, this font delivers a timeless handcrafted look that adds character and strength to every design.\nPerfect for vintage logos, retro branding, t-shirts, apparel, labels, posters, whiskey packaging, coffee branding, craft products, badges, signage, stickers, Cricut projects, sublimation, book covers, invitations, merchandise, social media graphics, and printable designs. Whether you’re creating rustic branding or nostalgic artwork, Vintage Strong gives your projects a bold, worn, and authentic vintage appearance.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Vintage Strong is a rugged vintage grunge display font featuring bold serif letterforms with authentic distressed textures. Inspired by classic western signs, old print shops, rustic branding, and retro typography, this font delivers a timeless handcrafted look that adds character and strength to every design.</p>\n<p>Perfect for vintage logos, retro branding, t-shirts, apparel, labels, posters, whiskey packaging, coffee branding, craft products, badges, signage, stickers, Cricut projects, sublimation, book covers, invitations, merchandise, social media graphics, and printable designs. Whether you’re creating rustic branding or nostalgic artwork, Vintage Strong gives your projects a bold, worn, and authentic vintage appearance.</p>",
